  "prefLabel": "Bfa 504.01 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bfa 504.01 Scope. This part applies to a user who wants to finance a project through the authority's issuance of bonds and is seeking a reservation and an allocation of bond limit. The procedures described in this part are similar to the procedures established for issuers, other than the authority, to apply for reservations and assignments of bond limit under Bfa 503.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Bfa 100) #5719, eff 10-13-93",
